<p>Your privacy is important to me. This privacy policy explains how I collect, use, and protect any information you provide when you use this website.</p>

<h2>Information I Collect</h2>
<p>I may collect the following information:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Your name and contact details when you fill out the contact form.</li>
    <li>Technical information automatically collected by the site, such as your IP address, browser type, and pages visited.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How I Use Your Information</h2>
<p>The information I collect may be used for:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Responding to inquiries or messages you send through the contact form.</li>
    <li>Improving the content and user experience of my portfolio website.</li>
    <li>Sending occasional updates or announcements if you subscribe.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>This site does not use cookies to store personal information. Any analytics or tracking data collected is anonymous and used only to improve the website experience.</p>

<h2>Data Protection</h2>
<p>I take reasonable steps to protect your information from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. Your personal information will never be sold or shared with third parties.</p>

<h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
<p>This website may contain links to external websites. I am not responsible for the privacy practices of these third-party sites.</p>

<h2>Consent</h2>
<p>By using this website, you consent to the collection and use of information as described in this policy.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact me</p>